    sh:in ( <http://data.europa.eu/949/concepts/ato-state/unknown> <http://data.europa.eu/949/concepts/ato-state/CO> <http://data.europa.eu/949/concepts/ato-state/NA> <http://data.europa.eu/949/concepts/ato-state/AV> <http://data.europa.eu/949/concepts/ato-state/RE> <http://data.europa.eu/949/concepts/ato-state/EG> <http://data.europa.eu/949/concepts/ato-state/DE> <http://data.europa.eu/949/concepts/ato-state/FA> ) ;
